msgid ""
"For each pair A - B, tests if A is better predicted as a linear function of "
"B, i.e., l := A ~ 1 + B, or a quadratic function of B, i.e., q := A ~ 1 + B "
"+ B^2.\n"
"    Uses the default settings for Bayesian regression, i.e., a JZS-prior "
"with alpha set to 0.354 and for the model prior a beta binomial distribution "
"with alpha = 1 and beta = 1. Note that since only two models are considered "
"the model prior is equivalent to a uniform model prior."
msgstr ""
"Untuk setiap pasangan A - B, menguji jika A lebih baik terprediksi sebagai "
"fungsi linear dari B, yaitu, l := A ~ 1 + B, atau fungsi kuadratik dari B, "
"yaitu, q :=A ~ 1 + B + B^2.\n"
"    Menggunakan pengaturan bawaan untuk regresi Bayes, yaitu, priori JZS "
"dengan alfa diatur ke 0.354 dan untuk priori model distribusi binomial beta "
"a dengan alfa = 1 dan beta = 1. Dicatat bahwa sejak hanya dua model "
"dipertimbangkan priori model sama dengan priori model keseragaman."

msgid ""
"Evidence shown in favor of a linear model (l) against a quadratic model (q)."
msgstr ""
"Bukti ditampilkan mendukung model linear (l) terhadap model kuadratik (q)."

msgid ""
"Evidence shown in favor of a quadratic model (q) against a linear model (l)."
msgstr ""
"Bukti ditampilkan mendukung model kuadratik (q) terhadap model linear (l)."

msgid ""
"The Bernoulli family requires the dependent variable to be a factor with 2 "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga Bernoulli memerlukan variabel dependen berupa faktor dengan 2 "
"tingkat."

msgid ""
"The Binomial family requires the weights variable (i.e. total number of "
"trials) to be non-zero."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga Binomial memerlukan variabel berat (yaitu jumlah total percobaan) "
"berupa non-nol."

msgid ""
"The Binomial family requires the dependent variable (i.e. proportion of "
"successes) to be between 0 and 1 (inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga Binomial memerlukan variabel dependen (yaitu proporsi keberhasilan) "
"berupa antara 0 dan 1 (inklusif)."

msgid ""
"The Binomial family requires the weights variable (i.e. total number of "
"trials) to be an integer."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga Binomial memerlukan variabel berat (yaitu jumlah total percobaan) "
"berupa integer."

msgid ""
"The Gamma family and the Inverse Gaussian family require the dependent "
"variable to be positive."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga Gamma dan keluarga Gauss Invers memerlukan variabel dependen berupa "
"positif."

msgid "The Poisson family requires the dependent variable to be an integer."
msgstr "Keluarga Poisson memerlukan variabel dependen berupa integer."

msgid ""
"The Gaussian family with the log link requires the dependent variable to be "
"positive."
msgstr ""
"Keluarga Gauss dengan tautan log memerlukan variabel dependen berupa positif."

msgid ""
"The Gaussian family requires the dependent variable to be a numerical "
"variable."
msgstr "Keluarga Gauss memerlukan variabel dependen berupa variabel numerik."

msgid ""
"Multinomial logistic regression requires the dependent variable to be a "
"factor with at least 3 levels."
msgstr ""
"Regresi logistik Multinomial memerlukan variabel dependen berupa faktor "
"dengan setidaknya 3 tingkat."

msgid ""
"Ordinal logistic regression requires the dependent variable to be a factor "
"with at least 3 levels."
msgstr ""
"Regresi logistik Ordinal memerlukan variabel dependen berupa faktor dengan "
"setidaknya 3 tingkat."

msgid ""
"Firth logistic regression requires the dependent variable to be a factor "
"with 2 levels."
msgstr ""
"Regresi logistik Firth memerlukan variabel dependen berupa faktor dengan 2 "
"tingkat."

